Subject: Re: Manual method for measurement invariance of ordinal variables for moderation analysis
Message-ID: <pErZzrM6dbE.J73cgoy9BAAJ@lavaan.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <pErZzrM6dbE.ZtdOhrN3AwAJ@lavaan.groups.google.com>
